Package: openmediavault-notifier
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0.5-2),
         python3,
         util-linux,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: openmediavault notification channels plugin
 Forwards openmediavault system notifications to Discord, Slack, Telegram,
 ntfy and Gotify, and sends improved email messages. Notifications are
 classified and enriched, e.g. file system alerts name the disk label and
 the shared folders on it, before delivery.
